flowchart TB
  accTitle: Distribution changes where the union appears
  accDescr: Wrap distributes over string and number and yields a union of two object types. WrapTogether tests the tuple-wrapped union together and yields one object type with a union-valued property.
  U["Input type
string | number"] --> W["Wrap: naked T
test each union member"]
  W --> D["{ value: string }
OR { value: number }"]
  D ~~~ T["WrapTogether: tuple [T]
test union together"]
  T --> N["One object type
value: string | number"]
  class U,W,D,T,N control;

